12b:T1190,**A strong network for waste management companies, recyclers and solution providers – shaping innovation together**

*Waldems, October 2025* – The circular economy thrives on collaboration, practical relevance and innovation. By joining the **Entsorger Circle**, plastship is strengthening exactly this connection: the new network unites waste management companies, recyclers, waste producers and solution providers who are jointly driving digital transformation and sustainability in the recycling sector.

Under the motto **“Together. Practical. Solution-oriented.”**, the Entsorger Circle offers a platform where knowledge transfer, digitalisation and AI take centre stage – with the goal of increasing productivity and profitability within the waste management industry.

## FOCUS: Digitalisation, AI & Innovation in Waste Management Practice

The Entsorger Circle already connects more than 50 companies from the recycling sector in a unique exchange format. With twelve specialist events per year – ranging from online sessions and site visits to innovation workshops – the network showcases practical solutions and technologies that are already delivering results today.

[Learn more](https://entsorger-circle.org/)

![](/images/cms/20230925-logo-entsorger-circle-grun-rgb-7d829c.webp)

> We are seeing that many waste management companies and recyclers are actively seeking tangible solutions for digitalisation – and this is precisely where the Circle comes in: it brings practitioners together to share experiences and learn from one another,

explains **Andreas Bastian, Managing Director of plastship**.

## plastship contributes digital expertise & practical use cases

As a digitalisation partner for the circular economy, plastship contributes its expertise in recyclate management, data integration and AI-driven material flow optimisation to the network.

One example is the [**KISS Project**](/benchmark/) (“AI-based Qualification, Control and Optimisation of Material Flows”):\
A platform demonstrating how Artificial Intelligence analyses material flows, optimises recycling pathways and enables more efficient use of recyclates – practical and cross-sectoral.

In addition, plastship connects manufacturers, recyclers and waste managers along the value chain to jointly develop market-ready and sustainable solutions.

## Insights from the network – current programme: AI, Digitalisation & Practical Solutions

*"With the Entsorger Circle, we are creating a platform that unites digitalisation, AI and practical expertise – helping companies to achieve tangible progress. Our goal is to make working solutions visible and to develop them further together"*,

says **Dr Moritz Gomm, Founder of the Entsorger Circle**.

Members can look forward to a diverse programme covering key topics of the circular economy and digital transformation.

**Upcoming Events in 2025:**

📅 5 November 2025 (online)\
**AI in Waste Collection & Sorting – More Efficient, More Accurate, More Cost-Effective**

📅 3 December 2025 (online)\
**The Digital Customer Interface – Portals, Apps & Messengers for Successful Customer Engagement**

[See the full programme](https://entsorger-circle.org/programm/)

![](/images/cms/firefly-kunststoff-rezyklat-handeschutte-e3c701.webp)

## Member Benefits: Knowledge, Exchange & Visibility

Members of the *Entsorger Circle* benefit from:

- Early access to new technologies, solutions and market trends
- Practical exchange with industry peers on challenges and best practices
- Exclusive networking with over 50 leading companies in the sector
- Increased visibility as an active driver of the circular economy

## TOGETHER FOR THE FUTURE

> The *Entsorger Circle* represents what the industry needs most: collaboration instead of isolated solutions. We are delighted to contribute our know-how and, together with the members, drive new impulses for digitalisation, AI and the circular economy,

adds **Andreas Bastian**.

plastship invites companies from the waste and recycling industries to join the network and shape the future of the sector together.

#### Entsorger Circle – The Network for Digitalisation, AI & Innovation in Waste Management

**👉** [**Join now**](https://entsorger-circle.org)

If you have questions or suggestions, please contact me!

**Mirco Gattinger**, Marketing & Social Media Manager\
